<title>USA: Stillwater Mining Co to move to ASE.</title>
<headline>Stillwater Mining Co to move to ASE.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stillwater Mining Co said on Wednesday it received approval for the listing of its common stock on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company, which will trade under the symbol expects to begin trading on June 5, 1997. The company currently trades on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Stillwater Mining Co produces platinum and palladium.</p>
